soul-tim-berners-lee = "Tim Berners-Lee (living, 71; Solid and Inrupt; This Is for Everyone, 2025; speaking through 2026 on fixing the web). The web, linked data and the semantic web; Solid pods give each person control of their data. Relevance: hyperactivity is the theory of knowledge graphs (docs/hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs.cub) with identity carried by paths, not URIs, and colocates agency and access with identity, which is what Solid seeks for data."
